---
// Dark, full-bleed testimonial over an ember background image (55% overlay), with a sand accent override.
---

<section id="section-theme-tokens" class="section theme theme--dark theme--accent-sand theme--full-bleed">
  <!-- kit: section-theme-tokens -->
  <img class="theme__bg" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/hearth-embers/1600/1000" alt="Close-up of glowing embers under a cast iron pot" width="3200" height="2000" loading="lazy" />
  <div class="theme__overlay" style="--overlay: 0.55" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container theme__split">
    <figure class="theme__quote">
      <svg class="theme__mark" viewBox="0 0 48 36" width="48" height="36" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 36V20C0 8 6 1 18 0v7c-6 1-9 5-9 11h9v18zm30 0V20c0-12 6-19 18-20v7c-6 1-9 5-9 11h9v18z" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
      <blockquote>
        <p>Our restaurant runs four Ember ovens over live fire every night. Two years in, they cook better than the day they arrived.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Chef Amara Osei</strong>
        <span>Hearth &amp; Ash, Portland</span>
      </figcaption>
      <a class="btn theme__btn" href="/journal/hearth-and-ash" title="Cooking for 90 over live fire">Read Amara's story <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </figure>
    <div class="theme__photo">
      <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/amara-osei/900/1100" alt="Chef Amara Osei lifting the lid of an Ember Dutch oven over coals" width="1800" height="2200" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .theme {
    --theme-accent: #d9b98c;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: clamp(80px, 11vw, 140px);
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--dark-ink);
  }
  .theme__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .theme__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background: rgb(20 19 23 / var(--overlay));
  }
  .theme__split {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: center;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .theme__split {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .theme__quote {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .theme__mark {
    color: var(--theme-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .theme__quote blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.2vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .theme__quote blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .theme__quote figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .theme__quote figcaption strong {
    color: var(--theme-accent);
  }
  .theme__quote figcaption span {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dark-ink) 70%, transparent);
  }
  .theme__btn {
    border-color: var(--theme-accent);
    color: var(--theme-accent);
    background: transparent;
  }
  .theme__btn:hover {
    background: var(--theme-accent);
    color: var(--dark);
  }
  .theme__photo img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 11;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45);
  }
</style>
